  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759360,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 12 (Nintendo DS) - A Family Mini-Game Collection\n\nStep into a world of lighthearted fun with *12*, a charming mini-game collection designed for family enjoyment, originally released for the Nintendo DS. Developed by NorthPole Studio Co. and published by Phoenix Games, this quirky title features twelve distinct and engaging mini-games, each offering a unique gameplay experience. \n\nWhile the game was initially known as \"12 Family Games,\" it's a compact package of entertainment suitable for players of all ages.  The collection was unfortunately never released outside of Europe, making it a somewhat rare find. \n\nExpect a variety of challenges, from puzzle-solving and skill-based activities to cooperative games perfect for sharing with loved ones.  Though details on a central narrative are scarce, the focus remains firmly on accessible and enjoyable gameplay. *12* provides a nostalgic glimpse into the Nintendo DS era, offering a simple yet delightful diversion for families seeking a casual gaming experience."
    },
